Why AGPLv3?

Pflegra is free software for families navigating the German care system.
The AGPLv3 ensures that:

1. Anyone who uses this software — including as a hosted service — must make
   the source code available to their users.

2. Modifications must be shared under the same license.

3. Commercial entities cannot take this project, rebrand it, and sell it
   as a closed product without contributing back.

In short: it stays free and open for everyone who needs it.

Full license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html
